{"allowed_english": [], "context": {"approved_glossary_entries": [], "generation_contexts": [{"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04R5:paragraph/0003", "hash": "sha256:3dd358cda749648ab5e3dc57d7d71294f88792969cae48e991287e725457e985", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 303421, "byte_start": 303185, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:9fa0c03eef3ba266469c7e3b7eb618aa8ec4f046609f76d74f842ae66f6b70e6", "line_end": 7998, "line_start": 7994}, "owner_tag": "04R5", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(X, x) \\to (S, s)$", "MATH_0002": "$(U_s, x)$", "MATH_0003": "$U \\to S$", "MATH_0004": "$(X_s, x)$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:27ce5d6fd07b29bb3e80fe9ac4b07ca2bd187fe1550cca2940e36d4e845e3697", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ed65c8a20e9e3e88bd4df802f83d35e040e1cf23d859e8447ad2c31cf6449d36", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nGiven a morphism of germs of schemes <MATH_0001>\nwe can define the <TEXTITOPEN_0001>fibre<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> as the isomorphism class of germs\n<MATH_0002> where <MATH_0003> is any representative. We will often abuse notation\nand just write <MATH_0004>.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:181fd8079f7d45fadbc7b09520338b7758b63a3df46daa1653247ad3e7f965e2", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:04R5:paragraph/0003"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04NJ:proof/0001", "hash": "sha256:a33101dbd6a83d426bd44c9353c525cc91e8a4233215f1d0dc3ca04775ca4c43", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 304029, "byte_start": 303732, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:e2eae142dd672c7cfd511d7201edbefe34a4e2a7f1e09219c74e9c36d0948740", "line_end": 8021, "line_start": 8013}, "owner_tag": "04NJ", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$U'_{v'} \\to U_v$", "MATH_0002": "$u'$", "MATH_0003": "$u$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-local-source-target-at-point}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-etale-on-fiber}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-dimension-local-ring-local}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7a0dbaa5095fd5c1a802edf45d54a97343e0df218f82388b1fc48662d18daab7", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ba0782fd7f9f1e6cb534e2e194b3d6ce43865adf6222398301981ffc879e8089", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nGiven a diagram as in\nDefinition <REF_0001>\nwe obtain an <ACCENT_0001>tale morphism of fibres\n<MATH_0001> mapping <MATH_0002> to <MATH_0003>, see\nLemma <REF_0002>.\nHence the result follows from\nLemma <REF_0003>.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:75786e29edaab4ff00aabadefeaaa7706aedd8c07c389adaefef9a1f8e1e7bf2", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:04NJ:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04NJ:lemma/0001", "hash": "sha256:5e94ef533c97466d210f0c86efec684d2b48d5de13d3fb7cc737b10bcacd043c", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 303730, "byte_start": 303423, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:e7da6ae74d22ecc9f316d64a856441e1139693a1f8e1982783102ec718e610de", "line_end": 8011, "line_start": 8000}, "owner_tag": "04NJ", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "math_text_regions": [{"delimiter_kind": "display-d